  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">End Wildlife Crime Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the five-year activity is to conserve biodiversity and strengthen rules-based order by building on the long history of the USAID Regional Development Mission for Asia in countering wildlife trafficking (CWT). This activity builds upon the successes of prior CWT activities, notably USAID Wildlife Asia and USAID Reducing Demand for Wildlife (RDW)</narrative>
  </description>
